    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to my tech blog!</p><span id="more"></span><h3 id="🌟-Open-Source"><a href="#🌟-Open-Source" class="headerlink" title="🌟 Open Source"></a>🌟 Open Source</h3><p>Contributing to <strong>100k+ Stars</strong> in AI Agent ecosystems:</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href="https://github.com/FoundationAgents/OpenManus">OpenManus</a></strong> (Founder)<br><em>An open and powerful AI Agent framework.</em> <code>51.4k ⭐</code></p></li><li><p><strong><a href="https://github.com/FoundationAgents/MetaGPT">MetaGPT</a></strong> (Core Contributor)<br><em>The Multi-Agent Framework.</em> <code>61.3k ⭐</code></p></li></ul><h3 id="💫-About-Me"><a href="#💫-About-Me" class="headerlink" title="💫 About Me"></a>💫 About Me</h3><p>I focus on <strong>Large Language Models (LLM)</strong> and <strong>AI Agents</strong>.</p><ul><li>🎓 Master’s student at <strong>East China Normal University</strong>.</li><li>💭 Vision: <em>“Building a smarter world where AI truly understands humanity.”</em><br><em>(…or just stopping it from destroying us 🤖)</em></li></ul><hr><h3 id="🚀-Connect-with-Me"><a href="#🚀-Connect-with-Me" class="headerlink" title="🚀 Connect with Me"></a>🚀 Connect with Me</h3><p align="left">  <a href="https://github.com/mannaandpoem" style="text-decoration: none;">💼 GitHub</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;   <a href="mailto:mannaandpoem@gmail.com" style="text-decoration: none;">📧 Email</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;   <a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/liang-xin-bing-13" style="text-decoration: none;">📚 Zhihu</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;   <a href="https://x.com/manna56749964" style="text-decoration: none;">🐦 Twitter/X</a></p><p>For more details, please visit my <a href="/about/">About</a> page.</p>]]></content>
    
    
